    "title": "Vincent van Gogh's 'Sunflowers' has returned",
    "text": "Vincent van Gogh's 'Sunflowers' has returned!🌻\n\nAfter a short visit to our friends at Philadelphia Museum of Art, you can find the much-loved painting back on display in Room 43 alongside several other works by the artist. \n\nThe sunflower pictures were among the first paintings Van Gogh produced in Arles that show his signature expressive style. No other artist has been so closely associated with a specific flower, and these pictures are among Van Gogh’s most iconic and best-loved works: https://bit.ly/2FtK7dN",
